      "text": " They are regularly shaped and thought to be captured asteroids."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:49.116",
      "start": "00:00:44.144",
      "text": " Jupiter, the largest planet in our solar system, has the most moons."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:55.155",
      "start": "00:00:49.116",
      "text": " Some of its well-known moons include Ganymede, Kalisto, Io, and Europa."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:59.660",
      "start": "00:00:55.155",
      "text": " Saturn, famous for its majestic rings, has numerous moons."
    },
