      "start": "00:00:59.660",
      "text": " Its largest moon, Titan, is even larger than the planet Mercury."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:08.435",
      "start": "00:01:04.231",
      "text": " Uranus has a relatively large number of moons, but they are much smaller compared to those"
    },
    {
